<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-WOMEN'S INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-WOMEN'S INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Indira Gandhi</p>
<p>Gold Cup women's hockey tournament on Tuesday:</p>
<p>India beat Russia 5-0 (halftime 4-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Kamla Dalal 4, Manjinder Kaur 5, Sandeep Kaur 7, Sita</p>
<p>Gussain 33, Ferdina Ekka 49.</p>
<p>South Korea beat China 3-2 (halftime 0-2)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>South Korea - Jung Jang-Eun 38, Jung Cho-Eun 43, Sook</p>
<p>Choi-Kwan</p>
<p>45</p>
<p>China - Liu Ying 12, Chen Jing 33</p>
</text>
